                    -------------------------------                             
                    Design: We fine‐tune a pretrained                           
                    MobileNetV2 on the binary malignant vs                      
                    non‐malignant task by replacing its                         
                    classifier head with a single‐unit                          
                    output. Images are resized to 224×224                       
                    with random crops, flips, and ImageNet                      
                    normalization, and we split the 16,577                      
                    samples into an 80/20 stratified                            
                    train/validation set. We train for five                     
                    epochs with AdamW optimizing                                
                    BCEWithLogitsLoss, evaluate the                             
                    validation AUROC using sklearn’s                            
                    roc_auc_score, and save the best model                      
                    to './working/model.pth'. A reusable                        
                    predict(folder_path) function loads the                     
                    saved model and returns malignancy                          
                    probabilities for new images.                               
                    Code: import os                                             
                    import pandas as pd                                         
                    import numpy as np                                          
                    from PIL import Image                                       
                    from sklearn.model_selection import                         
                    train_test_split                                            
                    from sklearn.metrics import                                 
                    roc_auc_score                                               
                    import torch                                                
                    import torch.nn as nn                                       
                    from torch.utils.data import Dataset,                       
                    DataLoader                                                  
