                    successfully without any errors. The                        
                    model was trained using CutMix data                         
                    augmentation and test-time augmentation                     
                    (TTA) with flips, achieving a strong                        
                    validation AUROC of 0.9301. This                            
                    indicates the model is effective at                         
                    classifying malignant versus benign                         
                    lesions with good fairness                                  
